Every guideline-clinical-evidence-review lacks a written-agreement-or-treatment-plan-effectiveness-study.
If a clinician clearly documents a treatment-plan with a patient before an opioid-prescribing and the treatment-plan includes a specific-functional-goal then the clinician clarifies an opioid-prescribing-and-monitoring-expectation with the patient for a patient-safety-health-and-well-being-improvement.
